============================================================================================
Objects (EXACT rational), all as meas over x in [0,1):
  p0          = all 7 sectors hit by {frac(e_i x)}            (sector route; p0<=cap => survive)
  1-p0        = >=1 sector missed
  g*=gap>2/7  = THM-527 'good' (maxgap{frac(e_i x)} > 2/7)    (g*>0 => M>=1/14)
  gap>1/7     = a >1/7 hole (the sector route's NATURAL gap)
  sect2adj    = two cyclically-adjacent sectors BOTH missed

KEY INCLUSIONS to verify:
  (A) {gap>2/7} subset {>=1 sector missed}  =>  g* <= 1-p0
  (B) {gap>2/7} subset {gap>1/7}            =>  g* <= gap>1/7
  (C) {gap>2/7} ?= {two adjacent sectors missed}  (the 2/7 <-> adjacency link)

